---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { staticPages } from '../../i18n/ui';
import { IMPRESSUM } from '../../config';
import AboutPhotos from '../../components/AboutPhotos.astro';
---

<PageLayout lang="en" title="About" description="Fincanla is an independent coffee site publishing simple, clear guides for people who brew at home. Here is how we work and how we are funded." alternates={staticPages.about}>
  <h2>Who is behind Fincanla?</h2>
  <p>Hi, I'm <strong>Abdul</strong>. Coffee plays a big part in my family's life: the cezve goes on the stove several times a day at our home, and the first thing we offer guests is always a cup of Turkish coffee. We live in Germany, and that tradition came with us.</p>
  <p>With coffee so much a part of our everyday life, I wanted to gather what we know and keep learning in one place. That's how Fincanla started: a simple, clear guide for everyone who makes coffee at home, from Turkish coffee to drip, from the cezve to the espresso machine.</p>
  <AboutPhotos lang="en" />
  <p>Fincanla exists for people who want better coffee at home. Our goal is simple: cut through the jargon, explain methods that work step by step, and help you spend money on the right gear.</p>
  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Method first, products second.</strong> Every article answers "how do I do this?" before recommending anything.</li>
    <li><strong>No hype.</strong> We list the downsides of every product. There is no universal "best", only what fits your needs.</li>
    <li><strong>Kept up to date.</strong> Articles are reviewed regularly; the last update date is shown at the top.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>The site is funded by ads and affiliate links. If you buy through a link we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. See our <a href={staticPages.disclosure.en}>affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  <h2>How we write our articles</h2>
  <p>Our articles are based on our own coffee habits, manufacturer information and reliable sources. We use digital tools, including artificial intelligence, for writing and translating. If you spot a mistake, just let us know and we'll fix it.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For questions, suggestions or your own coffee photo: <a href={`mailto:${IMPRESSUM.email}`}>{IMPRESSUM.email}</a></p>
</PageLayout>
